55997	56055	55988	55989	Mr. Vincy	315	“ I never professed to be anything but worldly ; and , what ’s more , I do n’t see anybody else who is not worldly . I suppose you do n’t conduct business on what you call unworldly principles . The only difference I see is that one worldliness is a little bit honester than another . ”
